# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Flow: Gadgetzan -> fly to Orgrimmar (Rise of the Silithid) -> zeppelin to the Undercity -> fly to
# Tarren Mill -> the Hinterlands (Gilveradin, Highvale, Revantusk Village, the Overlook Cliffs, Rin'ji,
# the Shaol'watha and the Altar of Zul, Jintha'Alor, the Witherbark village for Grim Message) ->
# Revantusk -> fly to Tarren Mill (Venom Bottles) -> fly to the Undercity (Oran Snakewrithe; Chemist
# Cuely's vials for Azshara) -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar.
#
# Accepted here, finished later on the route: Return to Fel'Zerul (1444, Stonard around 51),
# Ripple Delivery (81, Orgrimmar at the end of this guide), Wild Hearts (3123, Feralas next).

step Fly to Orgrimmar
  zone Tanaris
  goto 51.6,25.5 "Gadgetzan flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  turnin 32                             -- Zilzibin Drumlore, Valley of Spirits

step Zeppelin to Undercity
  zone Durotar
  goto 50.8,13.5 "Zeppelin to Undercity"

step Fly to Tarren Mill
  zone Undercity
  goto 63.3,48.6 "Undercity bat handler"
  fly "Tarren Mill"
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills

step The Hinterlands
  zone The Hinterlands
  goto 26.7,48.6 "The Hinterlands"

step Gilveradin's camp
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Ride north-east from Tarren Mill into the Hinterlands and east along the road; Gilveradin Sunchaser camps on the hill south of the elves' Quel'Danil Lodge.
  turnin 650                            -- Gilveradin Sunchaser
  accept 77

step Highvale
  tip The Highvale elves camp around Quel'Danil Lodge. Burn the report, the notes and the records in their camps. Rin'ji is held inside the lodge: lead him out and fight off the ambush on the way.
  tip Careful: Groups of about three elves ambush the escort, usually twice.
  interact 144073 quest 2995.3          -- Highvale Report
  interact 144072 quest 2995.2          -- Highvale Notes
  interact 144071 quest 2995.1          -- Highvale Records
  accept 2742                           -- Rin'ji
  complete 2742

step Violet Tragan
  tip East of the village, the violet flower grows in the hills.
  collect 8526 quest 2641.1 @40.6,59.7 -- Underwater

step Revantusk Village
  tip Follow the roads east across the Hinterlands to the troll village on the eastern coast. Primal Torntusk stands up on top of the inn, above Lard: go up, the arrow cannot tell the levels apart.
  accept 7839                           -- Smith Slagtree
  accept 7845
  accept 7840
  accept 7850                           -- Primal Torntusk
  getfp "Revantusk Village"
  accept 7815                           -- Katoom the Angler
  accept 7849
  accept 7830
  accept 7829
  accept 7828                           -- Huntsman Markhor
  accept 7841                           -- Otho Moji'ko
  accept 7844                           -- Mystic Yayo'jin

step Revantusk Village
  when group 7816
  accept 7816

step The Overlook Cliffs: kill these as you meet them
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip The big turtles crawl along the beaches north of the village. Whiskey Slim's port bottles lie on the beaches between the village and the cliffs: pick up twelve. A snapjaw can drop OOX-09/HL's distress beacon, rarely: keep it.
  kill 2505 quest 7815.1
  collect 8704 optional                 -- OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon, a rare drop
  collect 3900 quest 580

step The Overlook Cliffs: kill these as you meet them
  when group 7816
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Gammerita is a level 48 elite: most classes solo it at level 50, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 19023 quest 7816.1 @80.4,58.2 map 1425

step Rin'ji's Secret
  tip The secret lies on the Overlook Cliffs, above the beach.
  turnin 2742 object 142127
  accept 2782 object 142127             -- for Oran Snakewrithe in the Undercity, around level 50

step Lard's lunch
  tip North along the coast, Lard's picnic basket is on the small island; a Vilebranch Kidnapper guards it.
  collect 19034 quest 7840.1 @84.5,41.2

step Cortello's Riddle
  when onquest 626
  turnin 626                          -- Underwater

step Shaol'watha: kill these as you meet them
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip West of the island, the Vilebranch scalpers hold the temples of Agol'watha and Shaol'watha. Slagtree's tools lie at one of the temples.
  tip The Silvermane Stalkers, Savage Owlbeasts and Razorbeak Skylords share the hills between the temples and Skulk Rock. Use the Wildkin Muisek Vessel on the owlbeasts you kill. The Skylords also drop Long Elegant Feathers: keep ten for Otho's second message.
  tip Careful: Silvermane Stalkers are level 47-48 and stay stealthed while out of combat. Up close they use Infected Bite. When a Silvermane Howler falls to 50% health or lower, it calls for help from anything within 25 yd.
  kill 2926 quest 7828.1
  collect 19033 quest 7839.1
  kill 4466 quest 7844.1
  kill 4467 quest 7844.2
  collect 19025 quest 7830.1
  kill 2929 quest 7829.1

step Skulk Rock
  tip The crates of Hinterlands Honey Ripple lie around the abandoned Horde camp at Skulk Rock, among the oozes.
  collect 8684 quest 77.1

step Wildkin Muisek
  tip Careful: Stealthed wolves and griffons roam the Valorwind Lake area.
  collect 9594 quest 3123.1
  use 9618 quest 3123.1 @61.0,42.8 map 1425
  collect 4589 x10 "Long Elegant Feather"

step The Altar of Zul: kill these as you meet them
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip On the way back east, the Vilebranch soothsayers hold the Altar of Zul, the troll temple south of the central hills. Qiaga and Morta'gya the Keeper (elite, 50) stand at its top: take the soothsayers on the lower steps.
  tip South-west, the Silvermane Howlers roam the hills east of the Witherbark villages.
  kill 4466 quest 7844.1
  kill 4467 quest 7844.2
  kill 2925 quest 7828.2

step OOX-09/HL
  tip Only with the distress beacon: the robot sits at the head of the river west of Skulk Rock. Escort it east to the shore beyond the Overlook Cliffs; its reward waits with Oglethorpe in Booty Bay.
  tip Careful: Two ambushes spawn during the escort: first three wildkin owlbeasts, then three trolls. Before each, the robot halts and announces it senses danger. Oozes, stealthed wolves and a large turtle along the path can join fights, and they respawn even if cleared beforehand.
  accept 485 optional
  turnin 485 optional                   -- Homing Robot OOX-09/HL
  accept 836 optional
  complete 836 optional

