step Grim Message
  when onquest 2932
  tip South of the lodge the Witherbark trolls hold their villages. Every one of them carries a skull: with twenty, use Nimboya's Pike to make the Laden Pike, then plant it inside the village.
  goto 23.4,58.1
  collect 9320 x20 "Witherbark Skull"
  use 15002 "Nimboya's Pike" @29.5,58.5
  use 9319 "Nimboya's Laden Pike" @29.5,58.5
  complete 2932

step Aerie Peak
  tip Ride all the way west to the Wildhammer town of Aerie Peak and place the message by the well in its centre. The town is full of Alliance guards: get in, place it and get out.
  goto 14.3,48.1 "Aerie Peak well"
  complete 7843

